Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	エアートリガー
	Desc	AIR/AIR-ACTION/AIR-CRUSHが
	Desc	50回以上成功すると
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(200%)
	
	Lang	en
	Title	Air Trigger
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>200%<#r> when succeed AIR / 
	Desc	AIR-ACTION / AIR-CRUSH 50 times.
	
	Attr	BTarget
	Indicator	INBoost
	CountDef	0

OnJudge:
	If	Counter	>=	50
	If	Answer	!=	M
		Boost	INBoost	Mul	2.0
	ClearIf
	
	If	Counter	<	50
	If	Answer	!=	A
	If	Answer	!=	M
	If	NoteCat	=	CAir
		Counter	1
		Boost	INBoost	Add	0.0
	ClearIf
